  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Crush or finely chop the garlic. Cut the tofu into 2cm chunks. Remove the tough inner stems from the kale, then coarsely chop the leaves. Coarsely chop the peanuts.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4221145/photos/large/62583_1-d8e6b7bc8ec4138970c905fbf8c6f7df.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Start curry: Bring a medium saucepan of water to the boil for the noodles. Heat 1 tbs vegetable oil in a medium deep frypan over medium heat. Cook the garlic and tofu, stirring, for 2 mins or until golden and warmed through. Add the curry paste and cook, stirring, for 1 min or until fragrant. Stir in the coconut milk until combined.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4221146/photos/large/62583_2-3447c675d16fc523c02e2d55f755eadd.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Simmer curry: Add the kale and 60ml (¼ cup) water to the tofu mixture. Cook, covered, for 2 mins. Remove the lid, reduce the heat to low and cook for a further 3 mins or until the sauce is thickened and the kale is tender. Stir in ½ tsp soy sauce. Remove the pan from the heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4221150/photos/large/62583_3-7849e68b0167c965df421790371a4a11.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook noodles: Meanwhile, cook the noodles in the pan of boiling water for 3 mins or until tender. Drain, then rinse under hot water to prevent the noodles from sticking (see Kitchen 101).",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4221154/photos/large/62583_4-1de1bd5b31d14ee2691d252815b9441c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Divide the noodles among bowls. Top with the tofu curry, scatter with the peanuts and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4221158/photos/large/62583_5-9301801d908739768375d58de0ffa12a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Kitchen 101: Rinsing the noodles helps to prevent them sticking together by removing some of the starch.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4221162/photos/large/62583_6-6059c05dadda4f66ace8eaf881a1e547.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
